# Licensing

This repository holds three different kinds of thing, and they are licensed
differently. The point of the split is that the editorial output should be as
reusable as the pitch implies — a site that asks readers to audit its verdicts
should let them quote and mirror those verdicts — while the third-party material
retained for that audit is not ours to relicense.

## 1. Software — MIT

Applies to `pipeline/`, `.github/`, and any other source code in this
repository.

